WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.320
See something downtown
that does not look right?

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.630
Report it on the safety
dashboard: by voice,

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.120
with the guided form,
or with a quick alert.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.840
Officers pick it up and
respond, and you get updates.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:20.550
Businesses nearby get an alert, and the
Lookout board shows who to watch for.

6
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.600
Everyone downtown can
follow the public live map.

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.290
Register with only your work email.

8
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.340
Scan the code to join.
